  <PMP_PersonaInterface.label>TODO</PMP_PersonaInterface.label>
  <!-- EN: A hookup station for high bandwidth data extraction from the AI cores of persona class mechanoids.\n\nThe interface detects and synchronizes with a target mechanoid’s psychodynamic neuro signature, enabling analog transfer via a direct wire uplink and low-resonance scanning array. Instead of relying on bulky, high-power brain imaging hardware, its volume is devoted to fit real time processing arrays, capable of translating the captured cognitive data into various outputs depending on the selected scanning mode.\n\nBy default, the interface produces persona data fragments, with a 40% chance to yield a second fragment if the total skill level of the subject exceeds 50.\n\nEngram mode will instead tune the interface to produce an engram of the passions, skill levels, and traits of the occupant. Note that this mode will result in additional temporary post interface effects due to elevated bandwidth usage!\n\nSubcore mode will instead tune the interface to encode a standard tier subcore for use in mechanoid creation of simpler grades than persona.\n\nHigh subcore mode will instead tune the interface to encode a high tier subcore for use in mechanoid creation of simpler grades than persona. Note that this mode will result in additional temporary post interface effects due to elevated bandwidth usage!\n\nAll operations will induce a period of "System Haze" which prevents the recently interfaced mech from utilizing an interface for an extended duration, while temporarily inflicting mild data processing limitations. -->
